  "description": "A gas plumber is a skilled tradesperson who installs, repairs, and maintains gas piping systems in homes and businesses. This profession requires technical training and certification, and involves working with potentially hazardous materials. The term 'gas plumber' is a real-world occupational title, and the meme humorously juxtaposes a child's innocent scientific curiosity with this specific, adult-oriented job.",
